  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of five numbers is <math><mn>0</mn></math> and their variance is <math><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></math> . If three of those numbers are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the other two numbers are",
    "image": null
  },
