  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the other two numbers be <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi></mi><mi>y</mi></math>.<br />According to the question,<br />Mean<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><msup><mrow><mi>&#963;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now, <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> {using <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> } <math><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />Solving <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> , we get,<br />If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />If <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />So, the other two numbers are <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></math>",
